# Extension-managed governance files (synced from VSIX on every activation)
.github/agents/
.github/skills/
docs/Guides/

# Prompts are extension-managed too, EXCEPT objective-discovery.prompt.md — the
# entry point of the selected-workflow → objective-discovery chain. It must travel
# with the workspace so the chain survives a clone without the extension installed.
# Use `dir/*` (NOT `dir/`) so git descends into the folder and the negation applies.
.github/prompts/*
!.github/prompts/objective-discovery.prompt.md
